    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26071" root="ضنأ" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَانِئٌ</span></b>  (S, O, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَانِئَةٌ</span> (Ks, S, O, Msb, K)
A woman <i>having many children:</i> (S, O, Msb,
K:) and in like manner, the latter, cattle (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاشِيَةٌ</span>)
<i>having numerous offspring.</i> (TA.)

